{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "448fa6f0-6d35-80c0-8ba8-202b175dd063",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T10:32:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic S. Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Recreation, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yes. [pause] I'm calling about... the skating area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The skating area, sure. Is that the outdoor rink you mean, down at the park?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The one... by the beach park. [line breaks up] Is it open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me there. Did you ask if it's open today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Open today. [pause] Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me pull up the schedule. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. It's open today, but the afternoon session is the main one. Mornings are limited, so I'd plan on after noon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After noon. Okay. [pause] Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it for yourself or a group?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a property. I manage... a few buildings. Tenants ask me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, that makes sense. Anything else I can look up for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] Well. One thing. I heard a song... on the radio. Can't place it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wish I could help with that one. I'd need a lot more than a radio, Dominic. Do you remember any of the words?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:32:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Never mind. [crosstalk] Just... it's stuck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Those are the worst. A music app on your phone might name it if you catch it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:32:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll try. [pause] Will I need to... call you back? About the skating?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:32:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're all set. If the weather changes the hours, it'd be posted on our page, but you don't need to call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:32:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good Monday!"
    }
  ],
